    "detailed_description": "A devilishly addictive retro arcade video game that goes into 3D and beyond. TimberMan VR is a simple game whose charm lies in its lack of storyline, while the advantage - is in your skill set.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">EASY TO LEARN HARD TO MASTER</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1887260/extras/05bbe32dfa6c25189f319b1d5737d62c.poster.avif?t=1725360408\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1887260/extras/05bbe32dfa6c25189f319b1d5737d62c.webm?t=1725360408\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1887260/extras/05bbe32dfa6c25189f319b1d5737d62c.mp4?t=1725360408\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>The game offers a simple and straightforward concept but with increasing difficulty. It is easy to learn but tough to master, providing a challenging and rewarding experience for players.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>4 maps (autumn, winter, spring &amp; halloween)<br></li><li>15 levels campaign<br></li><li>arcade mode</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">SHOP FOR A UNIQUE ITEMS</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1887260/extras/e055a1c2d8e268e094b1faa675c48c6d.poster.avif?t=1725360408\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1887260/extras/e055a1c2d8e268e094b1faa675c48c6d.webm?t=1725360408\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1887260/extras/e055a1c2d8e268e094b1faa675c48c6d.mp4?t=1725360408\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Timberman VR features an in-game shop where players can purchase new tools, such as axes, machetes, and hammers, to enhance their gameplay experience and set higher records. The shop offers a variety of stylish and powerful tools:<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>axes (stone Age Axe, tomahawk, Bat)<br></li><li>machetes (futuristic, Viking, candy)<br></li><li>hammers (meat Hammer, Shark, Thor)</li></ul></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">CUT YOUR WAY OUT</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1887260/extras/7acec2bf06f69b8d41308d5cb17e4023.poster.avif?t=1725360408\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1887260/extras/7acec2bf06f69b8d41308d5cb17e4023.webm?t=1725360408\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1887260/extras/7acec2bf06f69b8d41308d5cb17e4023.mp4?t=1725360408\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Players must overcome obstacles while chopping down trees. The game requires quick reflexes and precise movements to avoid branches, adding a layer of challenge to the already difficult task of chopping down the tree. The obstacles increase in difficulty as players progress, providing a test of skill and endurance.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">COMPETE AND BECOME A CHAMPION</h2>Timberman VR features an in-game leaderboard where players can compete with others by setting high scores. The game tracks and displays scores, providing a platform for players to showcase their skills and compete with friends and other players from around the world.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">ENJOY A SPECIAL EVENT CONTENT</h2>The game features spooky and festive elements, including bat axe, and decorations, to get players in the Halloween spirit. This special content adds an extra layer of excitement and provides a unique experience.",
